---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const title = 'Zero-Defect Achievement - HouseTech Group News';
const description = 'HouseTech Group celebrates zero-defect milestone as 10 millionth kitchen appliance unit ships without quality complaint, demonstrating world-class manufacturing excellence and quality management systems.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Header activeNav="news" />
  
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/news">News</a> / <span>Quality</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="content-area" style="max-width: 850px;">
        
        <header class="article-header">
          <span class="article-category">Quality</span>
          <h1 class="article-title">Zero-Defect Achievement: 10 Millionth Unit Shipped Without Quality Complaint</h1>
          <div class="article-meta-info">
            <span>📅 September 2023</span>
            <span>🏷️ Quality</span>
            <span>⏱️ 5 min read</span>
          </div>
        </header>

        <figure class="article-image-figure">
          <div style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #ca8a04, #a16207);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);">
            <svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)" stroke-width="1">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <figcaption class="article-image-caption">10 Million Unit Quality Milestone</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="article-body">
          <p>A milestone of extraordinary significance has been achieved at HouseTech Group: the 10 millionth kitchen appliance unit has shipped from our factory without a single quality complaint. This achievement, spanning over a decade of continuous production, represents the dedication of HouseTech's entire team to manufacturing excellence.</p>
          
          <p>The zero-defect achievement encompasses all products manufactured at HouseTech's facility, including range hoods, gas stoves, cooktops, and related kitchen appliances sold under OEM partnerships with brands in over 40 countries. Every unit that leaves our factory has passed rigorous quality control inspections.</p>
          
          <h2>Quality System Foundation</h2>
          <p>HouseTech's quality excellence is built on a comprehensive management system:</p>
          
          <ul>
            <li><strong>ISO 9001:2015 Certified:</strong> Internationally recognized quality management system covering all processes.</li>
            <li><strong>Six Sigma Methodology:</strong> Data-driven approach to continuous improvement and defect reduction.</li>
            <li><strong>Automated Inspection:</strong> Computer vision and sensor systems detect defects invisible to human inspectors.</li>
            <li><strong>Supplier Quality Management:</strong> Rigorous vetting and monitoring of component suppliers ensures consistent quality upstream.</li>
          </ul>

          <blockquote>
            "10 million units without a quality complaint is not luck—it's the result of systematic processes, continuous improvement, and a company culture that treats every unit as if it were for our own family. This milestone belongs to every team member who contributes to HouseTech's quality standards."
            <cite>— HouseTech Quality Director</cite>
          </blockquote>

          <h2>Customer Impact</h2>
          <p>For HouseTech's OEM partners and brand clients, this quality record translates directly to business benefits:</p>
          
          <p>Low warranty claims and return rates protect brand reputation and profitability. Consistent quality builds consumer trust in partner brands. Reduced quality-related customer service burden frees resources for growth initiatives.</p>

          <h2>Looking Forward</h2>
          <p>HouseTech views this achievement not as a destination but as a waypoint. New quality challenges emerge as products incorporate smart technologies and more complex features. The company's quality team is already developing next-generation inspection systems using artificial intelligence to maintain defect rates at near-zero levels.</p>
          
          <p>HouseTech's commitment to quality remains unwavering. Every team member understands that each unit we produce carries our reputation and our partners' brands. This responsibility is taken seriously every single day.</p>
        </div>

        <nav class="article-nav">
          <a href="/news/new-rd-center-opening" class="article-nav-link">
            <span class="article-nav-label">← Previous</span>
            <span class="article-nav-title">R&D Center Opening</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/news/european-distributor-partnership" class="article-nav-link" style="margin-left:auto;text-align:right;">
            <span class="article-nav-label">Next →</span>
            <span class="article-nav-title">European Partnership</span>
          </a>
        </nav>

        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:var(--spacing-xl);">
          <a href="/news" class="btn btn-accent-outline">← Back to All News</a>
        </div>

      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>